  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760326,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1992 Gaishi 190-in-1 Hua Mian Xuan Guan: A Whirlwind of Tales\n\nEmbark on an extraordinary adventure with *1992 Gaishi 190-in-1 Hua Mian Xuan Guan*, a sprawling collection of 190 classic Chinese folktales and legends for the Nintendo Entertainment System! Inspired by the legend of Empress Wu, the game begins with a whimsical decree – the Empress commands all flowers to bloom in winter, unleashing a chain of unforeseen events.\n\nPlayers navigate a vibrant world filled with diverse and fantastical locations, including the mysterious Country of Women and the unsettling Country of Two-Faced People. Each of the 190 games presents a unique story, ranging from heroic quests and cunning puzzles to charming romances and thrilling action sequences. \n\nGameplay varies wildly between titles, encompassing platforming, puzzle-solving, shooting, and even RPG elements. Experience a dazzling array of characters, stunning pixel art, and traditional Chinese music, all woven together in a tapestry of captivating narratives. Prepare for a truly epic and unpredictable journey through the heart of Chinese folklore!"
    },
